# model:
# model:ir.model.fields,help:barcodes_gs1_nomenclature.field_barcode_rule__gs1_content_type
#, []
msgid ""
"The GS1 content type defines what kind of data the rule will process the "
"barcode as:        * Date: the barcode will be converted into a Odoo "
"datetime;        * Measure: the barcode's value is related to a specific "
"unit;        * Numeric Identifier: fixed length barcode following a specific"
" encoding;        * Alpha-Numeric Name: variable length barcode."
msgstr ""
"GS1 tip sadržaja definira koju vrstu podataka će pravilo obraditi iz "
"barkoda:        * Datum: barkod će biti pretvoren u Odoo datum/vrijeme;"
"        * Mjera: vrijednost barkoda je povezana sa određenom jedinicom;"
"        * Numerički identifikator: barkod fiksne dužine sa određenim "
"kodiranjem;        * Alfanumerički naziv: barkod promjenjive dužine."

# model: code:addons/barcodes_gs1_nomenclature/models/barcode_rule.py
#, []
msgid ""
"The rule pattern \"%s\" is not valid, it needs two groups:\n"
"\t- A first one for the Application Identifier (usually 2 to 4 digits);\n"
"\t- A second one to catch the value."
msgstr ""
"Obrazac pravila \"%s\" nije validan, potrebne su dvije grupe:\n"
"\t- Prva za Aplikacioni identifikator (obično 2 do 4 cifre);\n"
"\t- Druga za hvatanje vrijednosti."

# model: code:addons/barcodes_gs1_nomenclature/models/barcode_rule.py
#, []
msgid "The rule pattern '%(rule)s' is not a valid Regex: %(error)s"
msgstr "Obrazac pravila '%(rule)s' nije ispravan Regex: %(error)s"

# model: code:addons/barcodes_gs1_nomenclature/models/barcode_nomenclature.py
#, []
msgid ""
"There is something wrong with the barcode rule \"%s\" pattern.\n"
"If this rule uses decimal, check it can't get sometime else than a digit as last char for the Application Identifier.\n"
"Check also the possible matched values can only be digits, otherwise the value can't be casted as a measure."
msgstr ""
"Nešto nije u redu sa obrascem pravila barkoda \"%s\".\n"
"Ako ovo pravilo koristi decimale, provjerite da ne može dobiti nešto drugo osim cifre kao posljednji znak za Aplikacioni identifikator.\n"
"Provjerite također da moguće poklopljene vrijednosti mogu biti samo cifre, inače vrijednost ne može biti pretvorena u mjeru."

# model:
# model:ir.model.fields,help:barcodes_gs1_nomenclature.field_barcode_nomenclature__is_gs1_nomenclature
#, []
msgid ""
"This Nomenclature use the GS1 specification, only GS1-128 encoding rules is "
"accepted is this kind of nomenclature."
msgstr ""
"Ova nomenklatura koristi GS1 specifikaciju, samo GS1-128 pravila kodiranja "
"su prihvaćena u ovoj vrsti nomenklature."

# model: code:addons/barcodes_gs1_nomenclature/static/src/js/barcode_parser.js
#, []
msgid "This barcode can't be parsed by any barcode rules."
msgstr "Ovaj barkod ne može biti parsiran bilo kojim pravilom barkoda."

# model: code:addons/barcodes_gs1_nomenclature/static/src/js/barcode_parser.js
#, []
msgid "This barcode can't be partially or fully parsed."
msgstr "Ovaj barkod ne može biti djelomično ili potpuno parsiran."

# model:
